<div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\" class=\"faq__title\"><h2 class=\"primary-heading ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"\">Frequently asked questions</h2><!----><div class=\"all-faqs ng-star-inserted\"><a id=\"viewAllFaq\" class=\"faq_link_button ng-star-inserted\" target=\"_self\" href=\"/en-SA/\n                  \" aria-label=\"\"><span> View all FAQs </span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-icons-outlined faq_icon icon-Link_chevron\"> chevron_right </span></a><!----></div><!----></div><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\"><mat-accordion class=\"mat-accordion faq__accordion\"><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-0 mat-expanded mat-expansion-panel-spacing ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-1 ng-tns-c1859850774-0 ng-animate-disabled mat-expanded mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Which flights are eligible for Miles upgrades?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-1\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-1\"> Which flights are eligible for Miles upgrades? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-1 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-0 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-0\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-0\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-0\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">Only Saudia-operated flights are eligible. Codeshare flights are excluded.</p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-2 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-3 ng-tns-c1859850774-2 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Can I upgrade one passenger if my booking has multiple travelers?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-1\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-3\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-3\"> Can I upgrade one passenger if my booking has multiple travelers? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-3 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-2 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-1\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-1\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-2\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">All passengers in the same booking number (PNR) must be upgraded together.</p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-4 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-5 ng-tns-c1859850774-4 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How many cabin can I upgrade?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-2\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-5\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-5\"> How many cabin can I upgrade? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-5 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-4 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-2\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-2\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-4\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">Only one cabin upgrade is permitted: either from <strong>Guest Class to Business Class</strong> or from <strong>Business Class to First Class</strong>.</p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-7 ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Will my Miles calculation change after the upgrade?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-3\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-7\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-7\"> Will my Miles calculation change after the upgrade? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-7 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-3\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-3\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-6\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">&nbsp;No. Both your<strong> Reward Miles</strong> and <strong>Tier Credits</strong> will continue to be calculated based on the original booking class prior to the upgrade.</p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-8 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-9 ng-tns-c1859850774-8 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Are all tickets eligible for upgrade?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-4\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-9\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-9\"> Are all tickets eligible for upgrade? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-9 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-8 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-4\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-4\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-8\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>There are tickets that are not eligible for Upgrade with Miles:\n</p>\n<p>•\tGuest Saver (U Class) ticket\n</p>\n<p>•\tspecial fare ticket\n</p>\n<p>•\tfree and discounted ticket\n</p>\n<p>•\tstaff ticket\n</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----></mat-accordion></div></div></div></div><!----></app-jss-faq><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container container--horizontal\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\">\n\n  <hr class=\"custom-divider\">\n\n  <!-- Divider -->\n</p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container container--horizontal\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text-button class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-title-text-button-container ng-star-inserted\"><h2 appaddtextlimit=\"\" class=\"title ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Terms and Conditions</span><!----></h2><!----><!----><!----><div class=\"link--text\"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text-button><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-list class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-list-component\"><ul class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>Miles Upgrades are available only on Saudia Flights (excluding Saudia codeshare flights operated by another carrier) and may be redeemed on a leg basis.</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>Upgrade with Miles is available only on flights operated and marketed by Saudia.</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>If a PNR includes multiple passengers, all passengers must be upgraded together; Partial upgrades for selected passengers within the same PNR are not allowed.</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>The baggage allowance is unchanged and will be the one of original booking  </h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>Members must have sufficient Reward Miles for the requested Miles Upgrade at the time they request a Reward Upgrade.</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>Only a single cabin upgrade is permissible e.g. Guest Class to Business Class, or Business Class to First Class.</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>Members must hold a confirmed ticket for the flight they wish to upgrade prior to requesting a Miles Upgrade.</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>Miles Upgrades are subject to specific reward seat availability.</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>All taxes (including airport and/or government taxes), fees and carrier-imposed charges where applicable are the responsibility of Members and must be paid prior to the issuance of the Miles Upgrade.</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>Members may upgrade any unused flight leg of the original ticket, even if a previous leg has already been flown. Upgrades redeemed with Miles are refundable in accordance with the program’s policy.</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Example: If your ticket includes travel from Jeddah → Riyadh → Dubai and you have already flown the Jeddah → Riyadh leg, you can still upgrade the remaining Riyadh → Dubai leg using Miles.</span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>For tickets upgraded using Miles, any previously purchased ancillary services will be lost.</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>Miles earned for a Reward Upgrade will be according to the booking class of original ticket before being upgraded.</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>For Cash + Miles tickets, any upgrade using Miles must be completed by the member who originally issued the ticket or by an authorized individual with the right to redeem the Miles.</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>Miles Upgrades are not permitted on Guest Saver (U Class), Special Fare, free and discounted tickets. Staff tickets are not eligible for upgrades using Miles.</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>The required number of Miles for upgrades is based on original ticket brand.</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div></li><!----></ul><!----><!----></div></app-jss-list><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}